      "text": "I'll be riding my bike to school. What about you? I'll be walking to school in the fall. In the winter, I might start taking the bus. I'm looking forward to the starting of school so I can see many of my friends again. Yes, I like to see my friends, but I don't like all the work we get. I like my summers too much. Yes, summer is nice, but vacation all the time would be boring. Hmm, I never thought of it that way. What did you do this summer? I played soccer a lot with my friends, and my family and I went to the beach. Oh, that sounds like fun. I took music lessons, and I got to play in a band. It was very fun. We played music at some baseball games. That must have been very interesting. Maybe you could play at the school one time.",
